WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Welcome. The guided tour introduces the NeuraNote workspace.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Navigation. The persistent sidebar connects the main areas of the app.

00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
First note. Locate Notes and the New Note starting point.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.000
Concept map. The tour introduces connections between ideas.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
Review. Learn where to practice recall and get feedback.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.757
Ready to start. The tour introduces Insights, then returns to the first-note starting point.
